FT                   /note="Domain:cl28325:MngR DNA-binding transcriptional
FT                   regulator, GntR family [Transcription]. This family
FT                   consists of repressors of the GntR family typically
FT                   associated with trehalose utilization operons. Trehalose is
FT                   imported as trehalose-6-phosphate and then hydrolyzed by
FT                   alpha,alpha-phosphotrehalase to glucose and glucose-6-P.
FT                   This family includes repressors mostly from Gram-positive
FT                   lineages and does not include the TreR from E. coli.
FT                   [Regulatory functions, DNA interactions] [Superfamily,
FT                   Aligned:10-86, Eval:2.5e-08, score:50.7, C-term missing]"
