FT                   /note="Domain:cl27520:CpaE Flp pilus assembly protein,
FT                   ATPase CpaE  [Intracellular trafficking, secretion, and
FT                   vesicular transport, Extracellular structures]. Members of
FT                   this protein family belong to the MinD/ParA family of
FT                   P-loop NTPases, and in particular show homology to the CpaE
FT                   family of pilus assembly proteins (see ). Nearly all
FT                   members are found, not only in a gene context consistent
FT                   with pilus biogenesis or a pilus-like secretion apparatus,
FT                   but also near a DEAD/DEAH-box helicase, suggesting an
FT                   involvement in DNA transfer activity. The model describes a
FT                   clade restricted to the Actinobacteria. [Superfamily,
FT                   Aligned:9-392, Eval:6.1e-39, score:140.2]"
