FT                   /note="Domain:cl28388:PstA ABC-type phosphate transport
FT                   system, permease component [Inorganic ion transport and
FT                   metabolism]. This model describes PtsA, one of a pair of
FT                   permease proteins in the ABC (high affinity) phosphate
