FT                   concentration of extrallular inorganic phosphate is low. A
FT                   constitutive, lower affinity transporter operates
FT                   otherwise. [Transport and binding proteins, Anions]
FT                   [Superfamily, Aligned:25-763, Eval:0.0e+00, score:865.0]"
