FT                   /note="Domain:cl00614:ADP_ribosyl_GH
FT                   ADP-ribosylglycohydrolase. Members of this family are the
FT                   enzyme ADP-ribosyl-[dinitrogen reductase] hydrolase (EC
FT                   3.2.2.24), better known as Dinitrogenase Reductase
FT                   Activating Glycohydrolase, DRAG. This enzyme reverses a
FT                   regulatory inactivation of dinitrogen reductase caused by
FT                   the action of NAD(+)--dinitrogen-reductase
FT                   ADP-D-ribosyltransferase (EC 2.4.2.37) (DRAT). This enzyme
