FT                   /note="Domain:cl25576:FliI Flagellar biosynthesis/type III
FT                   secretory pathway ATPase [Cell motility, Intracellular
FT                   trafficking, secretion, and vesicular transport]. Members
FT                   of this protein family are the FliI protein of bacterial
FT                   flagellum systems. This protein acts to drive protein
FT                   export for flagellar biosynthesis. The most closely related
FT                   family is the YscN family of bacterial type III secretion
FT                   systems. This model represents one (of three) segment of
FT                   the FliI family tree. These have been modeled separately in
FT                   order to exclude the type III secretion ATPases more
FT                   effectively. [Cellular processes, Chemotaxis and motility]
