FT                   /note="Domain:cl01907:YscJ_FliF Secretory protein of
FT                   YscJ/FliF family. All members of this protein family are
FT                   predicted lipoproteins with a conserved Cys near the
FT                   N-terminus for cleavage and modification, and are part of
FT                   known or predicted type III secretion systems. Members are
FT                   found in both plant and animal pathogens, including the
FT                   obligately intracellular chlamydial species and
FT                   (non-pathogenic) root nodule bacteria. The most closely
