FT                   /note="Domain:cl01411:QSregVF_b Putative
FT                   quorum-sensing-regulated virulence factor. QSregVF_b is a
FT                   family of short Pseudomonas proteins that are potential
FT                   virulence factors. The structure of UniProtKB:Q9HY15 a
FT                   secreted protein has been solved and deposited as Structure
FT                   3npd, from pfam13652. It is predicted that these two
FT                   adjacent proteins form a single transcriptional unit based
FT                   on the prediction that together they interact with their
FT                   adjacent protein PotD, which is the putrescine-binding
FT                   periplasmic protein in the polyamine uptake system
FT                   comprising PotABCD. These two adjacent proteins are
FT                   predicted to be quroum-sensing-regulated virulence factors.
