FT                   /note="Domain:cl00568:MotA_ExbB MotA/TolQ/ExbB proton
FT                   channel family. The MotA protein, along with its partner
FT                   MotB, comprise the stator complex of the bacterial
FT                   flagellar motor. MotAB span the cytoplasmic membrane and
FT                   undergo conformational changes powered by the translocation
FT                   of protons. These conformational changes in turn are
FT                   communicated to the rotor assembly, producing torque. This
FT                   model represents one family of MotA proteins which are
FT                   often not identified by the 'transporter, MotA/TolQ/ExbB
FT                   proton channel family' model, pfam01618. [Superfamily,
FT                   Aligned:27-185, Eval:3.3e-09, score:51.9]"
