FT                   or NAD(+) as a cofactor. This domain is the catalytic
FT                   adenylation domain. The NAD+ group is covalently attached
FT                   to this domain at the lysine in the KXDG motif of this
FT                   domain. This enzyme- adenylate intermediate is an important
